283509,MOO-34742,arnoldv,Balt Butterfly Ergonomic Executive Office Chair: Butterfly Tablet Arm,Balt Butterfly Ergonomic Executive Office Chair: Butterfly Tablet Arm,10,194.670,0,,"* Combining an impressive array of ergonomic features with a modern and elegant design, the Butterfly Chair gives you total control over your seating experience at an unbeatable price point.<br /> <EOL>* Engineered to support the body in all-day comfort and provide an ergonomic flt for a wide spectrum of body types.<br /> <EOL>* Stylish and breathable split-panel mesh back includes angle adjustment, tilt-lock in three positions, and tilt tension control.<br /> <EOL>* Contoured to provide optimum and natural lumbar support.<br /> <EOL>* Easily adjust the breathable mesh seat depth with the seat glide control.<br /> <EOL>* Seat measures 20""W x 20""D, and height adjusts from 18"" to 21"" on a smooth pneumatic cylinder.<br /> <EOL>* Curved headrest (6""H x 13""W) is breathable, features 2.5"" of height adjustment, and pivots to give correct neck support whether upright or reclining.<br /> <EOL>* Arm rests pivot and are height adjustable (3"") to work with a variety of work spaces, positions, and activities.<br /> <EOL>* Back also features a convenient built-in coat or jacket hanger.<br /> <EOL>* Includes durable 5-star base with dual-wheel casters for smooth mobility.<br /> <EOL>* Optional tablet arm accessory adds more functionality.<br /> <EOL>* Platform swivels and tilts, and measures 10.5""W x 8.5""D.<br /> <EOL>* Brackets adjust from 7.88"" to 14""W for either vertical or horizontal tablet orientation, and accommodate up to .63""D.<br /> <EOL>* Push button adjustment of arm joints locks in your desired positioning.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,10.500,8.500,8.500,1000,Y,37124,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Chairs and Stools",,106.010,,Wednesday 26 March 2014 06:46:46 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,83.220,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
283806,MOO-319AB,aqeela,Balt Clean-Tak Board: 2'H x 3'W,Balt Clean-Tak Board: 2'H x 3'W,7,74.660,0,,* Clean-Tak Vinyl contains bacteria inhibitors to protect from stain- and odor-causing microbial growth.<br /> <EOL>* Third party tested to be a low VOC emitting surface.<br /> <EOL>* Durable and washable vinyl also contains a minimum of 20% post-consumer waste.<br /> <EOL>* Featured with standard .88" clear anodized aluminum trim with hairline mitered corners.<br /> <EOL>* Anodized black aluminum trim available at an upcharge.<br /> <EOL>* Ten year guarantee.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant. <EOL>,,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,36,36,24,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,41.340,,Friday 28 March 2014 01:32:58 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,31.920,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
