284467,MOO-204AL,arnoldv,"Balt El Grande Projection Plus Multimedia Whiteboard: Deluxe Aluminum Trim, 5'H x 10'W","Balt El Grande Projection Plus Multimedia Whiteboard: Del Alum, 5 x 10",195,1211.790,0,,"* The versatile Projection Plus Board is the ideal choice for a multipurpose audio/ visual environment, serving as markerboard and projection surface in one.<br /> <EOL>* Matte gray magnetic porcelain steel surface cuts glare by 60% over standard porcelain steel boards, making it a superior projection surface.<br /> <EOL>* Surface requires cleaning with a damp cloth for optimum performance.<br /> <EOL>* Some ghosting may occur.<br /> <EOL>* Galvanized steel backer ensures board will lay flat and stay flat, reducing optical projection distortion for interactive applications.<br /> <EOL>* Also available in a 5' board height up to 16' long for larger environments.<br /> <EOL>* Anodized deluxe aluminum trim has a .88"" profile with hairline mitered corners.<br /> <EOL>* Black aluminum trim available at an upcharge.<br /> <EOL>* Features a full-length tackable map rail and a full-length accessory tray with rubber Dura-Safe end caps to eliminate sharp corners.<br /> <EOL>* Rounded anodized aluminum Presidential Trim includes injection-molded curved corner pieces for an upscale and modern board.<br /> <EOL>* Includes matching Magnetic Q-Tray for accessories.<br /> <EOL>* Available in silver or black.<br /> <EOL>* Fifty year guarantee.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,120,120,60,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,638.020,,Wednesday 02 April 2014 11:32:28 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,518.040,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
