229544,MOO-27620,nerissa,Balt Elevation Interactive Whiteboard Wall Mount: Short Arm,Balt Elevation Interactive Whiteboard Wall Mount: Short Arm,84,1056.580,0,,"* Add 18"" of pneumatic height adjustment to any board with the Elevation Pneumatic Height Adjustable Wall Mount.<br /> <EOL>* Install the mount wherever needed on your wall to allow easy board accessibility.<br /> <EOL>* Holds boards 33.5"" - 58"" high, up to 8' wide, and .38""- 5.25"" thick between 50 and 100 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* Optional bracket available to hold boards up to 9"".<br /> <EOL>* Call for details.<br /> <EOL>* Platinum powder-coat finish is attractive and durable.<br /> <EOL>* Projector arm included.<br /> <EOL>* Choose from short throw, super short throw, or ultra short throw.<br /> <EOL>* Holds up to 25 lb. projector.<br /> <EOL>* See diagram on feature sheet for technical specifications.<br /> <EOL>* Includes adapter for use with universal mounts.<br /> <EOL>* Has achieved GREENGUARD GOLD Certification.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,75,29,8,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,556.300,,Friday 31 May 2013 04:06:39 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,451.690,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
229482,MOO-27639,nerissa,Balt Elevation Mobile Stand and Adjustable Wall Mount with Short Throw Arm,Balt Elevation Mobile Stand and Adjustable Wall Mount with Short Throw,213,1973.550,0,,"* The Elevation Mobile Stand + Wall Mount package offers mobility and flexibility for virtually any board.<br /> <EOL>* Mount holds boards from 33.5"" - 58"" high, up to 8' wide, from 0.38""- 5.25"" thick, and between 50 and 100 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* Moves easily from room to room on heavy duty locking casters.<br /> <EOL>* Optional bracket available to hold boards up to 9"".<br /> <EOL>* Call for details.<br /> <EOL>* Brushed silver frame is attractive, durable, and adds storage for your computer, DVD player, and other AV equipment.<br /> <EOL>* Sold as a package with either a short throw projector arm, super short throw projector arm, or ultra short throw projector arm.<br /> <EOL>* Holds a projector up to 25 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* See diagram for arm specifications.<br /> <EOL>* Keep a laptop within arms reach with the optional adjustable sidewing arm (89.25"" to 130.38"" wide).<br /> <EOL>* Included shelf measures 17.75""W x 12.63""D.<br /> <EOL>* Second shelf available separately for additional equipment.<br /> <EOL>* Optional locking cabinet available for secure storage.<br /> <EOL>* Features ventilation holes and a removable shelf.<br /> <EOL>* Measures 26.88""H x 17.88""W x 15.13""D.<br /> <EOL>* Add the speaker shelf to provide easy mobile access to your speakers.<br /> <EOL>* Ideal for teleconferencing or large room environments.<br /> <EOL>* Adjusts 2"" in height.<br /> <EOL>* Optional electrical assembly with seven outlets available.<br /> <EOL>* Has achieved GREENGUARD GOLD Certification.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,98,58,30.250,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,1039.080,,Friday 31 May 2013 02:38:27 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,843.690,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
