283595,MOO-74954,arnoldv,Balt Enlighten Mobile Glass Whiteboard,Balt Enlighten Mobile Glass Whiteboard,72,847.200,0,,"* Compact and lightweight, the Enlighten Mobile Glass Dry Erase Whiteboard goes wherever it's needed with ease.<br /> <EOL>* Surface is double-sided modern glass dry erase, providing exceptional writability and erasability with no ghosting.<br /> <EOL>* Silver powder-coated steel trim with dual-wheel casters.<br /> <EOL>* Includes accessory tray on each side.<br /> <EOL>* Custom colors and screenprinting available.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,48,36,36,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,446.060,,Thursday 27 March 2014 03:33:39 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,362.180,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
