283831,MOO-E2H2PA-T1,aqeela,"Balt Green-Rite Whiteboard: Presidential Trim, Black, 1.5' x 2'","Balt Green-Rite Whiteboard: Presidential Trim, Black, 1.5' x 2'",12,91.830,0,,"* Green-Rite is an environmentally responsible magnetic porcelain steel dry erase surface that provides superior writability, color contrast with markers, and is virtually indestructible.<br /> <EOL>* Featured with black Presidential trim.<br /> <EOL>* Lengths of anodized aluminum are joined with curved injection-molded plastic corner pieces for an upscale, modern board.<br /> <EOL>* Cradle to Cradle CertifiedCM Silver, has achieved GREENGUARD GOLD Certification, and is level 1 certified to conform to the ANSI/BIFMA e3 Furniture Sustainability Standard.<br /> <EOL>* Certified boards incorporate material healthfulness, material reutilization, renewable energy use, water stewardship and social responsibility.<br /> <EOL>* Designed for Environment (DfE) Green-Rite products contain between 40% and 55% rapidly renewable materials.<br /> <EOL>* Green-Rite products are also durable, and can be easily remanufactured or refurbished with different frame and attachment features to provide a lifetime of stylish use.<br /> <EOL>* Aluminum frame and attachment materials are recyclable.<br /> <EOL>* Class A Fire Rated board.<br /> <EOL>* A full test report copy is available upon request.<br /> <EOL>* Fifty year guarantee.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,24,24,18,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,50.840,,Saturday 29 March 2014 12:35:40 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,39.260,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
