284082,MOO-661AA,aqeela,Balt Hang Up Board: 1.5' x 2',Balt Hang Up Board: 1.5' x 2',15,103.470,0,,"* The compact yet versatile Hang Up Board is the ideal multipurpose accessory board for cubicles and other personal work spaces.<br /> <EOL>* Durable dry erase whiteboard surface doubles as a magnetic bulletin board.<br /> <EOL>* Features stylish anodized aluminum trim with a slat panel designed to hold accessory trays, keeping pens, papers and other work necessities close at hand.<br /> <EOL>* Hang over a cubicle wall with optional cubicle board hangers.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,24,24,18,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,57.280,,Sunday 30 March 2014 08:07:32 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,44.230,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
284086,MOO-661AB,aqeela,Balt Hang Up Board: 2' x 3',Balt Hang Up Board: 2' x 3',22,134.280,0,,"* The compact yet versatile Hang Up Board is the ideal multipurpose accessory board for cubicles and other personal work spaces.<br /> <EOL>* Durable dry erase whiteboard surface doubles as a magnetic bulletin board.<br /> <EOL>* Features stylish anodized aluminum trim with a slat panel designed to hold accessory trays, keeping pens, papers and other work necessities close at hand.<br /> <EOL>* Hang over a cubicle wall with optional cubicle board hangers.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant. <EOL>",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,36,36,24,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,73.720,,Sunday 30 March 2014 08:12:41 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,57.400,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
283444,MOO-66643,arnoldv,Balt HG Desktop Monitor Mount Clamp + 1 Arm,Balt HG Desktop Monitor Mount Clamp + 1 Arm,9,324.450,0,,"* The HG flat Panel Monitor Clamp Arms are the most versatile “set and forget” LCD mounts available, featuring a wide range of easy one touch adjustments with no buttons, knobs, levers, or switches.<br /> <EOL>* Use just one hand to adjust tilt, swivel, and pan range.<br /> <EOL>* Spring-loaded joints ensure the arms stay in place, yet are easily repositionable.<br /> <EOL>* Arms save valuable desktop space while providing full adjustment for ergonomic viewing and accessibility.<br /> <EOL>* One arm included.<br /> <EOL>* Purchase additional arm for dual monitor support.<br /> <EOL>* Fits easily on the same vertical post.<br /> <EOL>* Dual-jointed arms feature 95° of tilt adjustment.<br /> <EOL>* Monitor mount joint features 180° of swivel and 110° of tilt adjustment.<br /> <EOL>* A full 360° of rotation adjustment allows you to fix your monitor(s) in either landscape or portrait orientation.<br /> <EOL>* Each arm holds a monitor up to 24"" and 22 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* VESA compatible mounting in 75mm x 75mm or 100mm x 100mm mounting patterns.<br /> <EOL>* Arm locks securely onto your desktop with a clamp mechanism that adjusts to accommodate desktops from.<br /> <EOL>* 5"" to 1.96"" thick.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,24.500,22,4.880,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,172.290,,Tuesday 25 March 2014 06:03:52 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,138.700,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
283438,MOO-66649,arnoldv,"Balt HG Flat Panel Wall Mounts: Large, Capacity: 32""-65""/185 lbs","Balt HG Flat Panel Wall Mounts: Large, Capacity: 32""-65""/185 lbs",35,787.950,0,,"* HG Articulating flat Panel Wall Mounts give you unmatched ease and range of positioning with ""set and forget"" adjustments.<br /> <EOL>* One handed tilt, pan, and swivel with no buttons, knobs, levers, or switches.<br /> <EOL>* Fine tune adjustable universal mount built in provides a comprehensive array of adjustments.<br /> <EOL>* Extending up to 22"" from the wall, the wall mounts provide ample space for a full range of easy positioning.<br /> <EOL>* Available in two sizes to accommodate virtually any flat panel.<br /> <EOL>* The smaller holds flat panels from 26"" to 52"" and up to 75 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* The larger holds flat panels from 32"" to 65"" and up to 185 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,34.250,21.630,20.630,1000,Y,37116,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Workstations",,414.870,,Tuesday 25 March 2014 04:33:35 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,336.850,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
283387,MOO-66648,arnoldv,"Balt HG Flat Panel Wall Mounts: Small, Capacity 26""-52""/75 lbs","Balt HG Flat Panel Wall Mounts: Small, Capacity 26""-52""/75 lbs",20,442.900,0,,"* HG Articulating flat Panel Wall Mounts give you unmatched ease and range of positioning with ""set and forget"" adjustments.<br /> <EOL>* One handed tilt, pan, and swivel with no buttons, knobs, levers, or switches.<br /> <EOL>* Fine tune adjustable universal mount built in provides a comprehensive array of adjustments.<br /> <EOL>* Extending up to 22"" from the wall, the wall mounts provide ample space for a full range of easy positioning.<br /> <EOL>* Available in two sizes to accommodate virtually any flat panel.<br /> <EOL>* The smaller holds flat panels from 26"" to 52"" and up to 75 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* The larger holds flat panels from 32"" to 65"" and up to 185 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,22.130,19.630,17.750,1000,Y,37116,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Workstations",,233.200,,Monday 24 March 2014 08:49:59 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,189.340,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
283443,MOO-66647,arnoldv,Balt HG Wall Mount Projector Mount,Balt HG Wall Mount Projector Mount,9,297.670,0,,"* HG Wall Mount Projector Arm is a fully adjustable way to bring interactivity to your AV environment.<br /> <EOL>* Features a fine tune universal mount.<br /> <EOL>* Compact form factor saves valuable wall space while providing full adjustment for ergonomic viewing and accessibility.<br /> <EOL>* Features on-center projector adjustment from 12.25"" to 21.25"" ideal for ultra short throw projectors, and includes tilt and swivel adjustment to fine tune your projection.<br /> <EOL>* Holds projectors up to 33 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,28.130,13.880,8.500,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,158.070,,Tuesday 25 March 2014 05:29:22 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,127.250,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
283389,MOO-66644,arnoldv,Balt HG Wall Mount Workstation,Balt HG Wall Mount Workstation,27,977.470,0,,"* The HG Wall Mount Workstation is the most versatile ""set and forget"" wall mount workstation available, featuring a wide range of one touch adjustments with no buttons, knobs, levers, or switches.<br /> <EOL>* Use just one hand to adjust tilt, swivel, and pan on each of the arms.<br /> <EOL>* Spring-loaded joints ensure the arms stay in place, yet are easily repositionable.<br /> <EOL>* Ideal for use in medical facilities, warehouses, or other high traffic areas where computer access for multiple operators is needed, this space saving station has a comprehensive array of adjustment ideal for virtually any user.<br /> <EOL>* The base unit includes a single monitor mount and a keyboard arm.<br /> <EOL>* Optional additional monitor arm and CPU holder available.<br /> <EOL>* Each accessory attaches by sliding onto the base.<br /> <EOL>* You choose where to lock each part into place.<br /> <EOL>* Base and components include cable management channels to keep cords out of your way.<br /> <EOL>* The dual-jointed adjustable keyboard arm features height adjustment, lateral adjustment, and tilts for ideal positioning.<br /> <EOL>* Keyboard tray measures 18.25""W x 10""D and includes a retractable mouse platform (8.5""W x 8.38""D) that can be used on the right or left side.<br /> <EOL>* Monitor arm accommodates a monitor up to 24""/22 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* Dual-jointed arms features swivel, tilt, and pan adjustment.<br /> <EOL>* Allows landscape and portrait orientation.<br /> <EOL>* VESA compatible mounting.<br /> <EOL>* Optional dual monitor mount arm available.<br /> <EOL>* Adjustable CPU holder accommodates CPUs from 2"" to 4.25""W and from 4.25"" to 7.88""D.<br /> <EOL>* Folds to 22.87""W x 7.91""D when not in use.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,34.630,22.880,8,1000,Y,37116,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Workstations",,514.650,,Monday 24 March 2014 08:55:06 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,417.870,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
