229500,MOO-27635,shamima,"Balt iTeach 2 Mobile Interactive Whiteboard Stand: Super Short Throw Arm, 75"" - 100""H x 58""W x 30.25""W",Balt iTeach 2 Mobile Interactive Whiteboard Stand: Super Short Throw A,155,2383.930,0,,"* Engage your audience anywhere with the iTeach 2 Mobile Electric IWB stand, a streamlined version of the original.<br /> <EOL>* Gives virtually any whiteboard instant mobility and height adjustability.<br /> <EOL>* Holds boards up to 4 1/2'H x 8'W x 5""D between 50 and 100 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* Optional bracket available to hold boards up to 9"".<br /> <EOL>* UL-approved electric system allows for 20"" of smooth height adjustment (from 12"" at the bottom to 84"" at the top) with a simple touch of a button on the wired remote.<br /> <EOL>* Meets ADA requirements and Architectural Barriers Act Accessibilities guidelines.<br /> <EOL>* Sold as a package with either a short throw projector arm, super short throw projector arm, or ultra short throw projector arm.<br /> <EOL>* Holds a projector up to 25 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* See feature sheet for arm specifications.<br /> <EOL>* Adjustable sidewing table option (89 1/4"" to 130 3/8"" wide) keeps a laptop within arm's reach.<br /> <EOL>* Included shelf measures 17 3/4""W x 12 5/8""D.<br /> <EOL>* Second shelf available separately for additional equipment.<br /> <EOL>* Optional locking cabinet available for secure storage.<br /> <EOL>* Features ventilation holes and a removable shelf.<br /> <EOL>* Measures 26 7/8""H x 17 7/8""W x 15 1/8""D.<br /> <EOL>* Add the speaker shelf to provide easy mobile access to your speakers.<br /> <EOL>* Ideal for teleconferencing or large room environments.<br /> <EOL>* Measures 31 1/2""W x 6""D.<br /> <EOL>* Adjusts 2"" in height.<br /> <EOL>* Optional electrical assembly with seven outlets available.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,100,58,30.250,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,1255.150,,Friday 31 May 2013 03:00:02 AM,0,0