283430,MOO-27690,arnoldv,Balt iTeach Desktop Tablet Charger,Balt Iteach Desktop Tablet Charger,15,695,0,,"* Easily charge and/or sync up to eight USB tablet or phone devices right on your desktop with the compact and attractive iTeach Desktop Sync/Charger.<br /> <EOL>* Controlled power management knows which devices need more power, helping to extend battery life and saving energy.<br /> <EOL>* Includes four charge indicators and on/off power switch.<br /> <EOL>* Charge or sync up to eight devices with one power cord to the wall.<br /> <EOL>* Unit works with most tablets and other devices that are charged via USB.<br /> <EOL>* USB port in the back of unit is used to sync to a master device, or daisy chain several together using a USB hub.<br /> <EOL>* Optional syncing mode can be accessed via an iTunes or Windows 7 host computer using the sync USB cable provided.<br /> <EOL>* Apple devices can be setup and configured using the Apple Configurator available directly from Apple and synced using iTunes.<br /> <EOL>* Non-Apple devices will appear as USB drives and can sync via dragging and dropping.<br /> <EOL>* Contact your tablet manufacturer to understand the best method of transferring files for your specific device.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,16.500,14,7,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,365.920,,Tuesday 25 March 2014 12:09:27 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,297.110,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
283324,MOO-27704,arnoldv,Balt iTeach Desktop Tablet Sync & Charger,Balt Iteach Desktop Tablet Sync & Charger,15,965,0,,"* Easily charge and/or sync up to eight USB tablet or phone devices right on your desktop with the compact and attractive iTeach Desktop Sync/Charger.<br /> <EOL>* Controlled power management knows which devices need more power, helping to extend battery life and saving energy.<br /> <EOL>* Includes four charge indicators and on/off power switch.<br /> <EOL>* Charge or sync up to eight devices with one power cord to the wall.<br /> <EOL>* Unit works with most tablets and other devices that are charged via USB.<br /> <EOL>* USB port in the back of unit is used to sync to a master device, or daisy chain several together using a USB hub.<br /> <EOL>* Optional syncing mode can be accessed via an iTunes or Windows 7 host computer using the sync USB cable provided.<br /> <EOL>* Apple devices can be setup and configured using the Apple Configurator available directly from Apple and synced using iTunes.<br /> <EOL>* Non-Apple devices will appear as USB drives and can sync via dragging and dropping.<br /> <EOL>* Contact your tablet manufacturer to understand the best method of transferring files for your specific device.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,16.500,14,7,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,508.090,,Monday 24 March 2014 03:44:44 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,412.540,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
283379,MOO-27695-2,arnoldv,Balt iTeach High Capacity Charge Cart: 16 Capacity,Balt iTeach High Capacity Charge Cart: 16 Capacity,180,2454.490,0,,"* Easily charge, or sync and charge up to 48 tablets simultaneously with the efficient and attractive iTeach High Capacity Sync/Charge Cart.<br /> <EOL>* Purchase a cart with charging capacity only for the number of devices you need: 16, 32, or 48.<br /> <EOL>* Standard storage shelves will be included in place of any charging shelf spaces not used.<br /> <EOL>* Use your own USB charging cords.<br /> <EOL>* No adapter necessary.<br /> <EOL>* Controlled power management knows which tablets need more power, providing a safe and secure way to keep your tablets up to speed, extending battery life and saving energy.<br /> <EOL>* Charge up to 2.1 Amps per device with one power cord to the wall.<br /> <EOL>* Tablet slots measure 8.13""H x .98""W x 12""D.<br /> <EOL>* Charge time indicators at each slot along with sync indicators on the sync and charge version.<br /> <EOL>* Charges many USB based devices.<br /> <EOL>* Please check with MooreCo or your device manufacturer for compatibility.<br /> <EOL>* USB cables not included.<br /> <EOL>* Update to a sync and charge cart for even more power and versatility.<br /> <EOL>* Sync via iTunes or a Windows 7 host computer using the sync USB cable provided.<br /> <EOL>* Non-Apple devices will appear in Windows Explorer as USB device and can be synced via drag and drop.<br /> <EOL>* Apple devices can be set up and configured using the Apple Configurator app available directly from Apple, and synced using iTunes.<br /> <EOL>* Non-Apple devices will appear as USB drives and can sync via dragging and dropping.<br /> <EOL>* Contact your tablet manufacturer to understand the best method of transferring files for your specific device.<br /> <EOL>* Body includes heavy duty 3"" casters, cord winder and power receptacle, and ventilation panels to keep devices cool.<br /> <EOL>* Optional 4"" casters available.<br /> <EOL>* Patent pending.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,40.250,27,20.250,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,1511.470,,Monday 24 March 2014 08:30:36 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,1227.250,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
