l.<br /> <EOL>* Optional 4"" casters available.<br /> <EOL>* Patent pending.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,82.370,,Tuesday 25 March 2014 12:52:24 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,64.130,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
283400,MOO-27679,arnoldv,Balt iTeach Tablet Charging and Syncing Cart,Balt Iteach Tablet Charging and Syncing Cart,245,4038.590,0,,"* Easily charge and transport up to 32 tablet devices with this modern and attractive cart.<br /> <EOL>* Combining modern aesthetics with tried and true functionality, this versatile design holds 32 iPads or other mobile computing devices in one secure and portable workstation.<br /> <EOL>* Controlled power management knows which tablets need more power, providing a safe and secure way to keep your tablets up to speed, extending battery life and saving energy.<br /> <EOL>* Designed for easy accessibility, the ergonomic placement of the charging slots means no getting on your hands and knees to load and unload.<br /> <EOL>* Plug works with many popular tablets equipped with a USB charging cable.<br /> <EOL>* Sliding top shelf locks to secure your tablets and also serves as a standing height work surface.<br /> <EOL>* The surface remains stable even when the sliding top is open.<br /> <EOL>* Upgrade to the new charge and sync cart and keep your tablets synced to a host computer.<br /> <EOL>* Sync via iTunes or a Windows 7 host computer using the sync USB cable provided.<br /> <EOL>* Apple devices can be set up and configured using the Apple Configurator app available directly from Apple, and synced using iTunes.<br /> <EOL>* Non-Apple devices will appear as USB drives and can sync via dragging and dropping.<br /> <EOL>* Contact your tablet manufacturer to understand the best method of transferring files for your specific device.<br /> <EOL>* Powder-coated steel body with coordinating HPL/edge banding.<br /> <EOL>* Durable 5"" swivel casters (two locking). Slots hold tablets up to.<br /> <EOL>* 88"" thick, accommodating most tablets even with a case.<br /> <EOL>* Tested and approved for Electromagnetic Compatibility to FCC 47 CFR Part 15; ICES-003, Issue 4 (2004) -FCC 47 CFR Part 15.107 Conducted Emissions and FCC 47 CFR Part 15.109 Radiated Emissions.<br /> <EOL>* Ten year warranty on cart.<br /> <EOL>* Two year warranty on electrical.<br /> <EOL>* Ships fully assembled.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,36,34.500,26,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,2486.940,,Monday 24 March 2014 11:03:17 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,2019.300,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
283321,MOO-27670,arnoldv,Balt iTeach Tablet Charging Cart,Balt Iteach Tablet Charging Cart,245,3541.520,0,,"* Easily charge and transport up to 32 tablet devices with this modern and attractive cart.<br /> <EOL>* Combining modern aesthetics with tried and true functionality, this versatile design holds 32 iPads or other mobile computing devices in one secure and portable workstation.<br /> <EOL>* Controlled power management knows which tablets need more power, providing a safe and secure way to keep your tablets up to speed, extending battery life and saving energy.<br /> <EOL>* Designed for easy accessibility, the ergonomic placement of the charging slots means no getting on your hands and knees to load and unload.<br /> <EOL>* Plug works with many popular tablets equipped with a USB charging cable.<br /> <EOL>* Sliding top shelf locks to secure your tablets and also serves as a standing height work surface.<br /> <EOL>* The surface remains stable even when the sliding top is open.<br /> <EOL>* Upgrade to the new charge and sync cart and keep your tablets synced to a host computer.<br /> <EOL>* Sync via iTunes or a Windows 7 host computer using the sync USB cable provided.<br /> <EOL>* Apple devices can be set up and configured using the Apple Configurator app available directly from Apple, and synced using iTunes.<br /> <EOL>* Non-Apple devices will appear as USB drives and can sync via dragging and dropping.<br /> <EOL>* Contact your tablet manufacturer to understand the best method of transferring files for your specific device.<br /> <EOL>* Powder-coated steel body with coordinating HPL/edge banding.<br /> <EOL>* Durable 5"" swivel casters (two locking). Slots hold tablets up to.<br /> <EOL>* 88"" thick, accommodating most tablets even with a case.<br /> <EOL>* Tested and approved for Electromagnetic Compatibility to FCC 47 CFR Part 15; ICES-003, Issue 4 (2004) -FCC 47 CFR Part 15.107 Conducted Emissions and FCC 47 CFR Part 15.109 Radiated Emissions.<br /> <EOL>* Ten year warranty on cart.<br /> <EOL>* Two year warranty on electrical.<br /> <EOL>* Ships fully assembled.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,36,34.500,26,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,2180.840,,Monday 24 March 2014 03:18:30 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,1770.760,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
229530,MOO-66614,nerissa,Balt Locking Cabinet,Balt Locking Cabinet,38,384.140,0,,"* Engage your audience anywhere with the iTeach 2 Mobile Electric IWB stand, a streamlined version of the original.<br /> <EOL>* Gives virtually any whiteboard instant mobility and height adjustability.<br /> <EOL>* Holds boards up to 4.5'H x 8'W x 5""D between 50 and 100 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* Optional bracket available to hold boards up to 9"".<br /> <EOL>* Call for details.<br /> <EOL>* UL-approved electric system allows for 20"" of smooth height adjustment (from 12"" at the bottom to 84"" at the top) with a simple touch of a button on the wired remote.<br /> <EOL>* Meets ADA requirements and Architectural Barriers Act accessibilities guidelines.<br /> <EOL>* Sold as a package with either a short throw projector arm, super short throw projector arm, or ultra short throw projector arm.<br /> <EOL>* Holds a projector up to 25 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* See feature sheet for arm specifications.<br /> <EOL>* Adjustable sidewing arm and shelf option (89.25"" to 130.38"" wide) keeps a laptop within arm's reach.<br /> <EOL>* Included shelf measures 17.75""W x 12.63""D.<br /> <EOL>* Second shelf available separately for additional equipment.<br /> <EOL>* Optional locking cabinet available for secure storage.<br /> <EOL>* Features ventilation holes and a removable shelf.<br /> <EOL>* Measures 26.88""H x 17.88""W x 15.13""D.<br /> <EOL>* Add the speaker shelf (6"" - 8""H x 31.5""W x 6""D) to get mobile access to your speakers.<br /> <EOL>* Ideal for teleconferencing or large room environments.<br /> <EOL>* Optional power strip surge protector with seven outlets available.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,26.875,17.880,15.130,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,202.260,,Friday 31 May 2013 03:51:01 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,164.220,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
284186,MOO-66203,aqeela,"Balt Locking Casters: Bottom, 4 Pieces","Balt Locking Casters: Bottom, 4 Pieces",3,17.320,0,,"* Create walls, cubicles and other work or display areas with Standard Modular Panels.<br /> <EOL>* Panels constructed with a lightweight 1.25"" honeycomb core.<br /> <EOL>* Available in tackable fabric in blue, gray, or nutmeg, or in half-and-half fabric and dry erase magnetic markerboard (blue fabric only).<br /> <EOL>* Framed in durable anodized aluminum with slots to securely hold connectors.<br /> <EOL>* Easy to assemble and disassemble panels when you need to change configurations or replace panels.<br /> <EOL>* Multiple connector options available to create custom configurations in 2-way straight or 90° connections, or in 3-way or 4-way 90° connections.<br /> <EOL>* Choose feet with casters (locking), glides, or a T-base with or without casters.<br /> <EOL>* Connectors are needed at the top and bottom of each connection, and each connector is designated as either a top or bottom connector in the line listing.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,10.060,,Monday 31 March 2014 08:05:39 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,7.400,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
71982,MOO-74861,racquel,Balt Lumina Mobile Room Divider: Platinum,Balt Lumina Mobile Room Divider: Platinum,65,661.530,0,,* Turn any space into a multifunctional environment using the Lumina&trade; Mobile Room Divider.<br /> <EOL>* Coordinates with other members of the Lumina&trade; series.<br /> <EOL>* Add to a personal workspace to allow for privacy or combine several to create a separate meeting area.<br /> <EOL>* Dividers feature a double sided magnetic dry erase markerboard surface.<br /> <EOL>* Available with platinum frame.<br /> <EOL>* Each divider comes with 3" casters (2 locking).,,1000000,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,72,39.500,20,1000,Y,37116,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Workstations",,348.450,,Wednesday 06 April 2011 09:14:00 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,282.920,0,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
284249,MOO-219PA-T1,arnoldv,"Balt Magne-Rite Whiteboard with Presidential Trim: Black, 1.5'H x 2'W","Balt Magne-Rite Whiteboard with Presidential Trim: Black, 1.5'H x 2'W",7,58.570,0,,"* Magne-Rite boards feature a magnetic dry erase surface made with PVC-coated steel, specially engineered for exceptionally smooth writability.<br /> <EOL>* Glossy white surface erases cleanly with no ghosting and provides excellent color contrast with markers.<br /> <EOL>* Rounded anodized aluminum Presidential Trim includes injection-molded plastic curved corner pieces.<br /> <EOL>* Available in black or silver.<br /> <EOL>* Includes matching Magnetic Q-Tray for markers and erasers.<br /> <EOL>* Ten year guarantee",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,24,24,18,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,32.430,,Tuesday 01 April 2014 01:35:49 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,25.040,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
