284637,MOO-567,shamima,Balt Multimedia Board Accessory Kit,Balt Multimedia Board Accessory Kit ,2,29.870,0,,"* Deluxe Dry Erase Board Accessory Kit - includes four packs of Rite-On Markers (16 total), and two Magnetic Eraser Cloths.<br /> <EOL>* Dry Erase Board Accessory Kit - includes one pack of Rite-On Markers (four total), and two Magnetic Eraser Cloths.<br /> <EOL>* Multimedia Board Accessory Kit - includes six packs of Rite-On Markers (24 total), two Magnetic Eraser Cloths, and a spray bottle for easy wet erasing.<br /> <EOL>* Rite-On Deluxe Whiteboard Kit - includes one pack of Rite-On Markers (four total), one Magnetic Eraser Cloth, one Magnetic Accessory Tray, and one bottle of Green-Erase Multi-Purpose Cleaner.<br /> <EOL>* Rite-On Frameless Whiteboard Kit - includes aluminum accessory tray with mounts, a set of two Rite-On dry erase markers, and one Magnetic Eraser Cloth, and a set of four rare earth magnets.<br /> <EOL>* Rite-On in Reach Whiteboard Kit - includes two packs of Rite-On Markers (eight total), one Magnetic Eraser Cloth, and one Magnetic Accessory Tray.<br /> <EOL>* Rite-On Whiteboard Starter Kit - includes three packs of Rite-On Markers (12 total), one Magnetic Eraser Cloth, and one bottle of Green-Erase Multi-Purpose Cleaner.",,999998,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,37127,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Accessories",,17.080,,Friday 04 April 2014 08:13:07 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,12.770,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
