147842,MOO-45851,nerissa,Balt Navigator Floor Stand Sign,Balt Navigator Floor Stand Sign,24,136.980,0,,"* Display your message anytime, anywhere with the Navigator floor Sign Stand.<br /> <EOL>* Perfect for restaurants, lobbies, and store fronts.<br /> <EOL>* Simple magnetic, non-glare sheet protector holds any standard 11""x17"" graphic in place and keeps it protected from dust, dirt, and damage.<br /> <EOL>* The Navigator floor Sign has a sturdy, modern design that stands just under 5-feet tall.",,1000000,1,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,57.500,18,14,1000,Y,55306,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Floor Stand Sign",,75.210,,Monday 20 August 2012 08:46:55 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,58.560,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
