229526,MOO-66615,nerissa,Balt Sidewing Table Plus Shelf,Balt Sidewing Table Plus Shelf,20,154.060,0,,"* Engage your audience anywhere with the iTeach 2 Mobile Electric IWB stand, a streamlined version of the original.<br /> <EOL>* Gives virtually any whiteboard instant mobility and height adjustability.<br /> <EOL>* Holds boards up to 4.5'H x 8'W x 5""D between 50 and 100 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* Optional bracket available to hold boards up to 9"".<br /> <EOL>* Call for details.<br /> <EOL>* UL-approved electric system allows for 20"" of smooth height adjustment (from 12"" at the bottom to 84"" at the top) with a simple touch of a button on the wired remote.<br /> <EOL>* Meets ADA requirements and Architectural Barriers Act accessibilities guidelines.<br /> <EOL>* Sold as a package with either a short throw projector arm, super short throw projector arm, or ultra short throw projector arm.<br /> <EOL>* Holds a projector up to 25 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* See feature sheet for arm specifications.<br /> <EOL>* Adjustable sidewing arm and shelf option (89.25"" to 130.38"" wide) keeps a laptop within arm's reach.<br /> <EOL>* Included shelf measures 17.75""W x 12.63""D.<br /> <EOL>* Second shelf available separately for additional equipment.<br /> <EOL>* Optional locking cabinet available for secure storage.<br /> <EOL>* Features ventilation holes and a removable shelf.<br /> <EOL>* Measures 26.88""H x 17.88""W x 15.13""D.<br /> <EOL>* Add the speaker shelf (6"" - 8""H x 31.5""W x 6""D) to get mobile access to your speakers.<br /> <EOL>* Ideal for teleconferencing or large room environments.<br /> <EOL>* Optional power strip surge protector with seven outlets available.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,130.375,12.630,3,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,84.590,,Friday 31 May 2013 03:47:02 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,65.860,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
283904,MOO-531,aqeela,Balt Skin Panel Adhesive: 4 Tubes,Balt Skin Panel Adhesive: 4 Tubes,12,54.530,0,,"* Renew or replace any torn or worn board with high end porcelain steel whiteboard panels.<br /> <EOL>* Panels also available with a chalkboard surface.<br /> <EOL>* Magnetic porcelain steel dry erase surface is engineered for superior color contrast with dry erase markers.<br /> <EOL>* Low gloss porcelain provides superior writability and erasability with no ghosting.<br /> <EOL>* Reduced surface light distortion enhances visibility to provide optimum eye comfort.<br /> <EOL>* Porcelain steel layer is permanently laminated to MDF, retaining rigidity while staying easy to handle.<br /> <EOL>* Available in .25"" or .5"" thick panels.<br /> <EOL>* Panel roller and adhesive available to ensure easy installation.<br /> <EOL>* Fifty year guarantee.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,30.190,,Saturday 29 March 2014 03:16:10 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,23.310,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
283905,MOO-545,aqeela,Balt Skin Panel Roller,Balt Skin Panel Roller,2,93.600,0,,"* Renew or replace any torn or worn board with high end porcelain steel whiteboard panels.<br /> <EOL>* Panels also available with a chalkboard surface.<br /> <EOL>* Magnetic porcelain steel dry erase surface is engineered for superior color contrast with dry erase markers.<br /> <EOL>* Low gloss porcelain provides superior writability and erasability with no ghosting.<br /> <EOL>* Reduced surface light distortion enhances visibility to provide optimum eye comfort.<br /> <EOL>* Porcelain steel layer is permanently laminated to MDF, retaining rigidity while staying easy to handle.<br /> <EOL>* Available in .25"" or .5"" thick panels.<br /> <EOL>* Panel roller and adhesive available to ensure easy installation.<br /> <EOL>* Fifty year guarantee.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant. <EOL>",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,51.810,,Saturday 29 March 2014 03:19:24 PM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,40.010,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
284317,MOO-212NC-BT,arnoldv,Balt Slim Bite Whiteboard with Dura-Rite Surface: 3'H x 4'W,Balt Slim Bite Whiteboard with Dura-Rite Surface: 3'H x 4'W,23,213.220,0,,"* The ABC Bite Board features a hidden Best-Bite tackless paper holder along the top of traditional anodized aluminum trim to display items with no damage.<br /> <EOL>* Available with Dura-Rite or Tuf-Rite surface.<br /> <EOL>* Dura-Rite HPL provides a wear-resistant surface at an affordable price, with smooth writability and easy erasability.<br /> <EOL>* Lasts up to 125 times as long as standard economy boards.<br /> <EOL>* Permanently adhered to a insulation board substrate.<br /> <EOL>* Tuf-Rite surface provides a vast improvement over standard economy melamine boards.<br /> <EOL>* Thermal fuse technology improves erasability and lasts up to three times as long.<br /> <EOL>* Dura-Rite carries a 20 year guarantee.<br /> <EOL>* Tuf-Rite carries a 5 year guarantee.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,48,48,36,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,116.110,,Tuesday 01 April 2014 10:33:35 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,91.150,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
