284184,MOO-66205,aqeela,"Balt Wall Connector: Top/Bottom, 1 Piece","Balt Wall Connector: Top/Bottom, 1 Piece",1,6.520,0,,"* Create walls, cubicles and other work or display areas with Standard Modular Panels.<br /> <EOL>* Panels constructed with a lightweight 1.25"" honeycomb core.<br /> <EOL>* Available in tackable fabric in blue, gray, or nutmeg, or in half-and-half fabric and dry erase magnetic markerboard (blue fabric only).<br /> <EOL>* Framed in durable anodized aluminum with slots to securely hold connectors.<br /> <EOL>* Easy to assemble and disassemble panels when you need to change configurations or replace panels.<br /> <EOL>* Multiple connector options available to create custom configurations in 2-way straight or 90° connections, or in 3-way or 4-way 90° connections.<br /> <EOL>* Choose feet with casters (locking), glides, or a T-base with or without casters.<br /> <EOL>* Connectors are needed at the top and bottom of each connection, and each connector is designated as either a top or bottom connector in the line listing.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,3.800,,Monday 31 March 2014 07:14:06 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,2.790,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
