229584,MOO-66628,khairy,Moore Boss 2 Security Rail: Top Mount,Moore Boss 2 Security Rail: Top Mount,4,42.550,0,,* Add the optional chrome rail to the top of the Boss 2 for extra equipment security and stability.,,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,23.940,,Friday 31 May 2013 05:13:38 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,18.190,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
71110,MOO-27513,jesan,"Moore Boss: Silver, 36.5""H x 23.5""W x 20.5""D","Moore Boss: Silver, 36.5""H x 23.5""W x 20.5""D",135,1837.640,0,," <EOL>* The fully-featured Boss AV cart has everything you need for any audio visual environment.<br /> <EOL>* The modern and clean-lined unit assembles in less than 15 minutes.<br /> <EOL>* Durable and attractive powder-coated gray steel body with two fold-out side shelves, concealing a multimedia panel with AV input/output ports, USB ports, and a VGA port on one side, and a four-outlet/two jack electrical assembly on the othe.<br /> <EOL>* Fully ventilated unit includes locking front and rear doors for quick and secure access.<br /> <EOL>* Two cable storage boxes are conveniently located on the inside of the front doors.<br /> <EOL>* Inside the rear doors are two speaker shelves.<br /> <EOL>* Sound cut-outs on the rear door allow use even when closed.<br /> <EOL>* Includes a retractable angle-adjustble projector shelf, and two adjustable equipment storage shelves on the interio.<br /> <EOL>* Multiple grommets keep your cables organized and out of the way.<br /> <EOL>* Heavy duty casters (2 locking) and space-conscious form provide easy maneuverability in crowded rooms.<br /> <EOL>* Internal seven-outlet electrical assembly is mounted on the bottom back for easy access.<br /> <EOL>* Add even more functionality with a height-adjustable flat panel bracket that holds up to 42""/80 lbs, or a handy heightadjustable monitor arm that holds up to 22""/90 lbs and extends 20.5"". Available rack mount installs in minutes, and accommodates standard 19"" rack equipment.<br /> <EOL>* GREENGUARD Indoor Air Quality Certified and GREENGUARD Children & Schools CertifiedSM.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,967.530,,Tuesday 29 March 2011 11:26:46 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,785.590,0,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
