229159,MOO-34729,khairy,Moore Butterfly Chair,Moore Butterfly Chair,66,1175.360,0,,"* Combining an impressive array of ergonomic features with a modern and elegant design, the Butterfly Chair gives you total control over your seating experience at an unbeatable price point.<br /> <EOL>* Engineered to support the body in all-day comfort and provide an ergonomic fit for a wide spectrum of body types.<br /> <EOL>* Stylish and breathable split-panel mesh back includes angle adjustment, tiltlock in three positions, and tilt tension control.<br /> <EOL>* Contoured to provide optimum and natural lumbar support.<br /> <EOL>* Easily adjust the breathable mesh seat depth with the seat glide control.<br /> <EOL>* Seat measures 20""W x 20""D, and height adjusts from 18"" to 21"" on a smooth pneumatic cylinder.<br /> <EOL>* Curved headrest (6""H x 13""W) is breathable, features 2 1/2"" of height adjustment, and pivots to give correct neck support whether upright or reclining.<br /> <EOL>* Arm rests pivot and are height adjustable (3"") to work with a variety of work spaces, positions, and activities.<br /> <EOL>* Back also features a convenient built-in coat or jacket hanger.<br /> <EOL>* Includes durable 5-star base with dual-wheel casters for smooth mobility.<br /> <EOL>* Optional tablet arm accessory adds more functionality.<br /> <EOL>* Platform swivels and tilts, and measures 10 1/2""W x 8 1/2""D.<br /> <EOL>* Brackets adjust from 7 7/8"" to 14""W for either vertical or horizontal tablet orientation, and accommodate up to 5/8""D.<br /> <EOL>* Push button adjustment of arm joints locks in your desired positioning.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,51,28,24,1000,Y,37124,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Chairs and Stools",,618.840,,Thursday 30 May 2013 09:24:37 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,502.470,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
