71440,MOO-89786,jesan,"Moore Diversity Stand: Medium Oak, 37.5-45.5""H x 23.75""W x 26""D","Moore Diversity Stand: Medium Oak, 37.5-45.5""H x 23.75""W x 26""D",47,277.070,0,," <EOL>* The versatile Diversity Stand can be used as an AV center, a workstation, or as a lectern.<br /> <EOL>* GREENGUARD Indoor Air Quality Certified and GREENGUARD Children & Schools CertifiedSM.<br /> <EOL>* Adjusts in height from 37.5"" to 45.5"". Top shelf measures 23.75""W x 12""D.<br /> <EOL>* Slanted shelf measures 23.75""W x 11.75""D and is angled down 40º. Middle shelf measures 18.75""W x 15.75""D.<br /> <EOL>* Storage box measures 14.5""H x 18.75""W x 9.5""D.<br /> <EOL>* Black powder-coated steel frame Includes 3"" casters (two locking).",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,148.380,,Thursday 31 March 2011 08:21:34 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,118.450,0,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
71449,MOO-89875,jesan,"Moore Dual Adjustable Laptop Cart: Black, 42""H x 24""W x 18""D","Moore Dual Adjustable Laptop Cart: Black, 42""H x 24""W x 18""D",79,632.420,0,,"* The Dual Adjustable Laptop Utility Cart is durable and versatile.<br /> <EOL>* Black powder-coated steel frame includes 4"" casters (2 locking). Adjusts in height from 26"" to 42"". Includes a 26""H locking storage cabinet.<br /> <EOL>* Includes two adjustable retractable shelves to hold a projector or other equipment.<br /> <EOL>* Electrical assembly with four outlets, a 25' cord included.<br /> <EOL>* 10 year guarantee.<br /> <EOL>* GREENGUARD Indoor Air Quality Certified and GREENGUARD Children & Schools Certified.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,332.980,,Thursday 31 March 2011 09:00:10 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,270.360,0,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
71317,MOO-66582,jesan,Moore Dual Arm Wall Mount for Flat Panel Monitors Up to 23",Moore Dual Arm Wall Mount for Flat Panel Monitors Up to 23",5,217.510,0,," <EOL>* Low Profile Monitor Mount - Holds flat panel up to 23""/30 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* 180° of tilt and pan adjustment, and 360° rotation.<br /> <EOL>* 30° of tilt adjustment in either direction, and 180° pan adjustment.<br /> <EOL>* Dual Arm Monitor Mount - Holds flat panel up to 23""/30 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* Dual arm features 30° of tilt adjustment in either direction, 180° of pan adjustment, and 180° rotation.<br /> <EOL>* Height Adjustable Monitor Mount - Holds flat panel up to 23""/30 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* Height adjusts 7"", features 90° of tilt adjustment, 360° pan adjustment, and 360° rotation.<br /> <EOL>* Quick release tab.<br /> <EOL>* VESA compatible.<br /> <EOL>* Flat Panel Wall Mount Brackets - Smaller holds flat panels up to 42"" and 85 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* Larger holds from 42"" to 61"" up to 125 lbs (double stud wall installation required).<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,118.440,,Wednesday 30 March 2011 10:34:20 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,92.980,0,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
