229546,MOO-27621,nerissa,Moore Elevation Interactive Whiteboard Wall Mount: Super Short Arm,Moore Elevation Interactive Whiteboard Wall Mount: Super Short Arm,79,1029.500,0,,"* Add 18"" of pneumatic height adjustment to any board with the Elevation Pneumatic Height Adjustable Wall Mount.<br /> <EOL>* Install the mount wherever needed on your wall to allow easy board accessibility.<br /> <EOL>* Holds boards 33.5"" - 58"" high, up to 8' wide, and .38""- 5.25"" thick between 50 and 100 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* Optional bracket available to hold boards up to 9"".<br /> <EOL>* Call for details.<br /> <EOL>* Platinum powder-coat finish is attractive and durable.<br /> <EOL>* Projector arm included.<br /> <EOL>* Choose from short throw, super short throw, or ultra short throw.<br /> <EOL>* Holds up to 25 lb. projector.<br /> <EOL>* See diagram on feature sheet for technical specifications.<br /> <EOL>* Includes adapter for use with universal mounts.<br /> <EOL>* Has achieved GREENGUARD GOLD Certification.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,75,29,8,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,542.040,,Friday 31 May 2013 04:09:02 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,440.110,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
