143539,MOO-27650,jesan,Moore Elevation Mobile Stand with Flat Panel Mount,Moore Elevation Mobile Stand with Flat Panel Mount,155,1061.830,0,,"* The Elevation&trade; Mobile Stand + flat Panel Mount package offers mobility and flexibility for your large flat panel display.<br /> <EOL>* Mounting bracket accommodates up to a 70""/125 lb flat panel display and tilts for optimum visibility.<br /> <EOL>* Moves easily from room to room on heavy duty locking casters.<br /> <EOL>* Stand is fixed height, but flat panel bracket can be mounted at two different heights (43"" or 59"" on center; please note overall height and clearance will vary with size of display).<br /> <EOL>* Brushed silver frame is attractive, durable, and adds storage for your DVD player or computer.<br /> <EOL>* Optional adjustable sidewing table (89 1/4"" to 130 3/8"" wide) keeps a laptop within arms reach.<br /> <EOL>* Included shelf measures 17 3/4""W x 12 5/8""D.<br /> <EOL>* Second shelf available separately for additional equipment.<br /> <EOL>* Optional locking cabinet available for secure storage.<br /> <EOL>* Features ventilation holes and a removable shelf.<br /> <EOL>* Measures 26 7/8""H x 17 7/8""W x 15 1/8""D.<br /> <EOL>* Optional electrical assembly with seven outlets, a 25' cord, and cord winder available.<br /> <EOL>* Stand is GREENGUARD Indoor Air Quality Certified and GREENGUARD Children & Schools Certified.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,559.060,,Friday 03 August 2012 12:06:50 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,453.930,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
229566,MOO-82493,bhavesh,Moore Ergo E. Eazy Teak: Master Set,Moore Ergo E. Eazy Teak: Master Set,95,887.710,0,,"* The Ergo E. Eazy is the ultimate in ergonomic and adjustable workstations.<br /> <EOL>* Work surface adjusts instantly in height from 29"" to 39"" with a pneumatic lever, allowing use as a sit-down or stand-up workstation.<br /> <EOL>* Height adjustable keyboard platform includes a padded wrist rest, swivels from side to side, and tilts from -15° to 25°.<br /> <EOL>* Tilting mouse platform (7""W x 8""D) can be placed on either side of the keyboard.<br /> <EOL>* Printer shelf (25 1/2""W x 11 3/4""D) mounts anywhere on the back of the work surface.<br /> <EOL>* CPU holder mounts to either side of the desk.<br /> <EOL>* GREENGUARD Indoor Air Quality Certified and GREENGUARD Children & Schools Certified.<br /> <EOL>* True Adjust.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,41,39,29,1000,Y,37116,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Workstations",,467.390,,Friday 31 May 2013 04:45:10 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,379.500,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
71696,MOO-34434,jesan,"Moore Ergo Executive Chair: Black, 1/Cartoon, 51""H x 28""W x 24""D","Moore Ergo Executive Chair: Black, 1/Cartoon, 51""H x 28""W x 24""D",49,774.880,0,,"* The Ergo Ex is designed to provide unmatched comfort and unmatched customizability.<br /> <EOL>* Padded and contoured seat measures a generous 21""W x 18 1/2""D.<br /> <EOL>* Seat features adjustable depth, and is height adjustable from 17"" to 20"".<br /> <EOL>* Stylish mesh back (21""H x 20 1/2""W) tilts and includes adjustable lumbar support device.<br /> <EOL>* Padded head rest (10""H) tilts and is height adjustable.<br /> <EOL>* Arm rests swivel from side to side, slide back and forth, and adjust in height.<br /> <EOL>* Includes a durable 5-star base with casters for easy maneuverability.<br /> <EOL>* GREENGUARD Indoor Air Quality Certified and GREENGUARD Children & Schools Certified.<br /> <EOL>* We've Got Your Back.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,999998,2,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,37124,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Chairs and Stools",,446.720,,Saturday 02 April 2011 12:53:06 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,362.710,0,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
229559,MOO-27565,khairy,Moore FDB AV Cart,Moore FDB AV Cart,100,876.380,0,,"* The FDB AV Cart is large enough for all of your AV equipment yet small enough to easily handle.<br /> <EOL>* Wide top features ample room for a projector and a document camera.<br /> <EOL>* Cart is height adjustable from 31"" - 39"" in 1"" increments.<br /> <EOL>* Cabinet features grommet holes, and is perforated to cool equipment when in use.<br /> <EOL>* Interior measures 15""H x 32""W x 24""D with a 14""H x 30""W door opening.<br /> <EOL>* Includes four outlet electrical assembly.<br /> <EOL>* Seven outlet electrical assembly available to mount inside the cabinet.<br /> <EOL>* 10 year guarantee.<br /> <EOL>* GREENGUARD Indoor Air Quality Certified and GREENGUARD Children & Schools Certified.<br /> <EOL>* TAA compliant.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,39,32.250,24.250,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,461.420,,Friday 31 May 2013 04:28:14 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,374.650,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
