229555,MOO-27680,khairy,Moore Mobile Flat Panel Stand plus Electric Height Adjustable Mount,Moore Mobile Flat Panel Stand plus Electric Height Adjustable Mount,125,2092.950,0,,"* The Mobile Flat Panel Stand provides stability, portability, and unbeatable flexibility for flat panel displays and accessory options.<br /> <EOL>* Durable frame is finished with a brushed silver powder-coated steel.<br /> <EOL>* AV shelf measures 18""W x 14""D.<br /> <EOL>* Base shelf measures 2 1/2""H x 30 1/2""W x 29 1/2""D and includes 4"" urethane swivel casters (2 locking). Tested to hold 100 lbs without tipping.<br /> <EOL>* Stand is available packaged with one of three flat panel mounts.<br /> <EOL>* The standard mount holds up to a 42""/80 lb flat panel display.<br /> <EOL>* The high capacity mount holds a 42""-61""/100 lb display.<br /> <EOL>* Each tilts 30°.<br /> <EOL>* Add ultimate flexibility with the new electric height adjustable flat panel mount.<br /> <EOL>* UL-approved system provides 18"" of adjustability with a touch of a button on the handy wired remote.<br /> <EOL>* Angle-adjustable bracket holds a flat panel up to 80""/150 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* Optional video conferencing shelf mounts to the top of the cart.<br /> <EOL>* Optional sidewing table for a laptop or document camera requires mounting brackets, sold separately.<br /> <EOL>* One shelf included.<br /> <EOL>* Second shelf available.<br /> <EOL>* Optional electrical assembly with four outlets, a 25' cord, and cord winder mounts to the back of the base for easy access.<br /> <EOL>* Stand is GREENGUARD Indoor Air Quality Certified and GREENGUARD Children & Schools Certified.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,86.500,37.500,29.500,1000,Y,37118,"MooreCo, Inc./Balt/Audio Visual Presentation Furniture",,1101.950,,Friday 31 May 2013 04:19:39 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,346,,894.740,35,N,59,"MooreCo, Inc."
